---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { url } from "../lib/urls";
import Photo from "../components/Photo.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About Equator"
  description="Equator is a small Czech family company making titanium bicycles and carbon wheels. Equator Scandinavia brings them to riders in the Nordics."
>
  <section class="wrap about-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">About Equator</p>
    <h1>
      Czech roots.
      <br />
      Northern horizons.
    </h1>
    <p class="lead">
      A small family company from Zlín, building titanium bicycles and carbon
      wheels for riders who plan to keep them for a long time.
    </p>
  </section>

  <figure class="wrap about-photo">
    <Photo
      src="images/yasei-0.jpg"
      alt="Equator Yasei titanium gravel bicycle on a gravel road"
      sizes="100vw"
    />
  </figure>

  <section class="wrap about-grid">
    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <div>
      <p>
        Equator Cycling is a Czech cycling company based in Zlín. It describes
        itself as a small family business — one that believes cycling, like
        business, is about relationships.
      </p>
      <p>
        Equator started with carbon wheels. Titanium frames followed as what
        the company calls a logical next step. Today the range covers titanium
        road and gravel bicycles, framesets and carbon wheelsets.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap about-grid">
    <h2>How Equator designs</h2>
    <div>
      <p>
        Every frame is designed and tested across several prototypes, with a
        clear goal for how it should ride. Equator describes its bicycles as
        designed, tested and assembled in Czechia, using parts sourced from
        specialist suppliers around the world.
      </p>
      <p>
        The aim is a balance of performance, ride feel and durability — and the
        company says it learns from every frame it sells and every rider who
        gives feedback.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="titanium-band" id="titanium">
    <div class="wrap about-grid">
      <h2>Why titanium</h2>
      <div>
        <p>
          Titanium is chosen for riders who value durability and long-term
          ownership. It resists corrosion, so the frames can be left with a
          brushed, unpainted finish that wears its miles quietly.
        </p>
        <p>
          How a bicycle actually rides depends on its geometry, tubing, tyres
          and build — not on material alone. That's why each Equator family has
          its own purpose: Sensei for road and gravel, Raiden for the road, and
          Yasei for longer adventures.
        </p>
        <a class="text-link" href={url("bikes/")}>Compare the bikes</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap about-grid">
    <h2>A different scale</h2>
    <div>
      <p>
        Equator is not a mass-market manufacturer. The range is deliberately
        small, and the conversation is direct: you speak with people who know
        the bikes, not a call centre.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap about-grid">
    <h2>Equator Scandinavia</h2>
    <div>
      <p>
        Equator Scandinavia is the regional representation for Denmark, Sweden
        and Norway, starting in Copenhagen. We help riders and shops discover
        Equator, configure the right bicycle and connect with the manufacturer.
      </p>
      <p>
        Every build request is reviewed personally. We confirm price,
        availability and delivery with Equator before anything is paid.
      </p>

      <div class="about-actions">
        <a class="button" href={url("bikes/")}>Explore the bikes</a>
        <a class="text-link" href={url("contact/")}>Get in touch</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  .about-hero {
    padding: 72px 0 48px;
  }
  .about-hero .lead {
    max-width: 560px;
    font-size: 18px;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }
  .about-photo {
    margin: 0 auto 40px;
  }
  .about-photo :global(img) {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-height: 760px;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.3fr);
    gap: 64px;
    padding: 64px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
  }
  .about-grid h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.6rem);
  }
  .about-grid p {
    max-width: 620px;
    font-size: 16px;
  }
  .titanium-band {
    background: #f7f7f7;
  }
  .titanium-band .about-grid {
    border-top: 0;
  }
  .about-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 28px;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }
  .about-source {
    padding: 0 0 64px;
  }
  .about-source a {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
      padding: 44px 0;
    }
    .about-hero {
      padding: 44px 0 32px;
    }
  }
</style>
